      "id": "1806674509019111691",
      "text": "I really need a new twitter feed. 🙄\n\nI’m sick of politics, I’m sick of streamer drama, I’m sick of seeing the same big creators getting banned for being shit humans (happy they are getting what they deserve just sick of it being the only thing I see being talked about). \n\nI just want to go back to seeing gaming clips, and streamers excited about collabs, partnerships and other accomplishments. I want to see setups and selfies that make someone feel confident and proud. \n\n😔",
